## Authentication flow

- Cookie-based (default for browser): HttpOnly ldp_access + ldp_refresh + ldp_csrf CSRF token
- Bearer token (E2E/testing): useCookieAuth: false in environment.testing.ts
- SignalR: access_token query param
- JWT validation: supports current key + previous key (rotation — see Jwt:PreviousKey config)

