## Key services (Application layer — 29; full list in docs/module-map.md)

Important ones to know:
- `OrderService` — order CRUD, calls OrderStatusStateMachine for all status changes
- `OrderStatusStateMachine` — authoritative state machine, Domain layer
- `FileService` / `IFileStorageService` — file upload/download, supports Local + R2 providers
- `JwtService` — token issue and validation (supports key rotation via PreviousKey)
- `CurrencyService` — live USD/PKR rate via ExchangeRate-API, Redis cached, fallback safe
- `HangfireAuthorizationFilter` — restricts /hangfire dashboard to Admin/SuperAdmin
- `NotificationService` — SignalR push notifications
- `InvoiceService` — invoice generation + QuestPDF rendering
- `DesignerPayoutService` — PKR payout calculations

