## File storage

Provider is configured via `Storage:Provider` in appsettings:
- `"Local"` — dev default, stores in Files/ / Files_Dev/ / Files_Staging/
- `"R2"` — production/staging, Cloudflare R2 via AWSSDK.S3 (S3-compatible)

All file access goes through authorized API endpoints — never direct public URLs
unless `Storage:R2:PublicDomain` is configured. `UploadSecurityHelper` validates
type, size, and duplicate window on every upload.

---

## Database conventions

- Migrations live in: `LogoDesignPortal.Infrastructure/Migrations/`
- Run migrations at release time — `Database:RunAfterStartup: false` in production
- Never run raw SQL — always use EF Core migrations for schema changes
- Connection string env var: `ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection`

