## Configuration hierarchy (highest wins)

```
Environment variables
  └── appsettings.{Environment}.json
        └── appsettings.json
              └── User Secrets (Development only)
```

Key env vars:
- `ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection` — MySQL connection string
- `ConnectionStrings__Redis` — Redis connection string
- `Jwt__Key` — current JWT signing key (min 32 chars)
- `Jwt__PreviousKey` — previous JWT key (rotation window)
- `Storage__R2__AccountId` / `AccessKeyId` / `SecretAccessKey` — Cloudflare R2
- `ExchangeRate__ApiKey` — ExchangeRate-API key
- `SMTP credentials` — never committed

