## Quick commands

```bash
# Run all backend tests
cd Backend && dotnet test LogoDesignPortal.sln

# Run backend only (dev)
cd Backend/src/LogoDesignPortal.API && dotnet run

# Run frontend (dev)
cd Frontend && npm start

# Add EF migration
cd Backend/src/LogoDesignPortal.Infrastructure
dotnet ef migrations add {MigrationName} --startup-project ../LogoDesignPortal.API

# Deploy to IIS (staging/prod)
.\ops\deploy.ps1 -Version "1.4.3"

# Rollback IIS deploy
.\ops\deploy.ps1 -Rollback

# Run MySQL backup manually
.\ops\backup-mysql.ps1

# Format backend code
cd Backend && dotnet format LogoDesignPortal.sln
```

